flowchart TD
  A([SINPE Movil]) --> B[Show phone]
  B --> C[Copy activates code TTL 5 min]
  C --> D[User transfers via SINPE with code]
  D --> E[Webhook / SMS parsed]
  E --> F{Code in history active or expired?}
  F -->|Yes| G[Calculate ROJOS]
  G --> H[Credit on Stellar]
  H --> I([Shows in SINPE top-ups])
  F -->|No| J[PENDING_MANUAL_MATCH]
  J --> K{Customer claim with receipt?}
  K -->|Yes| L[Claim / queue]
  L --> M{Can credit?}
  M -->|Yes| G
  M -->|No| N([SINPE desk assigns])
  K -->|No| N
  C --> O{TTL expired before send?}
  O -->|Copy new code| C
  O -->|Already sent expired| K